      "text": "[6:18PM] #PWD #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood movement from Bolade intersection to Airport U-turn, with slight delays due to traffic lights. \nSteady journey from Airport U-turn to National, but slow movement on Ikeja flyover towards Ajayi Farm due to high traffic volume and pedestrian activity. \nAjayi Farm to Ile-Zik and Sule Junction is smooth, with minor delays at Ile-Zik due to traffic lights. \nIle-Zik to Iyana Dopemu underneath bridge via Mangoro and Cement is moving steadily. Return journey is smooth, with officers effectively managing traffic.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
